OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after boy, 13, stabbed
OL,4,Aon seafront
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a
OL,7,F13-year-old boy was stabbed in East
OL,8,FSussex on Sunday.
OL,10,FThe boy was attacked shortly after
OL,11,F17:00 BST at Grand Parade in
OL,12,FEastbourne, near the junctions of Elms
OL,13,FAvenue and Cavendish Place.
OL,15,FHe was airlifted to hospital after
OL,16,Fsustaining an injury consistent with a
OL,17,Fstabbing, police said, but is now
OL,18,Frecovering at home.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
